  "title": "Neptune Flood Surpasses 300,000 Policies in Force and $400 Million in Premium, Expanding Access to Modern Flood Protection Nationwide",
  "summary": "ST. PETERSBURG, Fla.–(BUSINESS WIRE)– Neptune Flood, the largest private flood insurance provider in the United States, today announced that it has surpassed 300,000 policies in force and $400 million in premium in force. This milestone marks a significant step forward in expanding the reach of private flood insurance and strengthening the resilience of communities across […]",
